/*
 * Non-combinable reference profiles. Each block describes the only writable
 * range for one RAM Recovery build. They are documentation/source fragments,
 * not one DTS that should be compiled as-is.
 */
/* IMAGE2_ONLY:
 * writable: image2-fit <0x03c00000 0x00600000>
 * writable: image2-ubi <0x04200000 0x03400000>
 * read-only: every other partition, including Config and selector
 */

/* SELECTOR_ONLY:
 * writable: selector <0x07a00000 0x00600000>
 * read-only: every other partition, including Config and both images
 */

/* OEM_IMAGE1_FULL_RESTORE:
 * writable: oem-image1-restore <0x00200000 0x03a00000>
 * read-only: every other partition, especially Image2 and selector
 */

/* All profiles use:
 * bootargs = "earlycon=uart8250,mmio32,0x11002000 console=ttyS0,115200n8 swiotlb=512 rdinit=/init";
 */
